{"id":"copper-sun","title":"Copper Sun","author":"Countee Cullen","year":"1927","note":"Harlem poems of love, race, and the long tower.","minutes":182,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Chapter 1","place":"Chapter 1","reentry":"From the Dark Tower","prompt":"What light does the poem hold?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"From the Dark Tower"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"(To Charles S. Johnson)"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"We shall not always plant while others"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"reap"},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"The golden increment of bursting fruit,"},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"Not always countenance, abject and mute,"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"That lesser men should hold their brothers"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"cheap;"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"Not everlastingly while others sleep"},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"Shall we beguile their limbs with mellow"},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"flute,"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"Not always bend to some more subtle brute;"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"We were not made eternally to weep."},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"The night whose      sable breast relieves the"},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"stark,"},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"White stars is no less lovely being dark,"},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"And there are buds that cannot bloom at all"},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"In light, but crumple, piteous, and fall;"},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"So in the dark we hide the heart that bleeds,"},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"And wait, and tend our agonizing seeds."},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"Threnody for a Brown Girl"},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"EEP not, you who love her;"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"What rebellious flow"},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"Grief undams shall recover"},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"Whom the gods bid gor"},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sorrow rising like a wall,"},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bitter, blasphemous,"},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"What avails it to recall"},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"Beauty back to usP"},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"Think not this grave shall keep her,"},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"This marriage-bed confine;"},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"Death may dig it deep and deeper;"},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"She shall climb it like a vine."},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"Body that was quick and sentient,"},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"Dear as thought or speech,"},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"Death could not with one trenchant"},{"id":"s0-36","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blow snatch out of reach."},{"id":"s0-37","sceneId":"s0","text":"She is nearer than the word"},{"id":"s0-38","sceneId":"s0","text":"Wasted on her now,"},{"id":"s0-39","sceneId":"s0","text":"Nearer than the swaying bird"},{"id":"s0-40","sceneId":"s0","text":"On its rhythmic bough."},{"id":"s0-41","sceneId":"s0","text":"Only were our faith as much"},{"id":"s0-42","sceneId":"s0","text":"As a mustard seed,"},{"id":"s0-43","sceneId":"s0","text":"4"},{"id":"s0-44","sceneId":"s0","text":"Aching, hungry hands might touch"},{"id":"s0-45","sceneId":"s0","text":"Her as they touch a reed."},{"id":"s0-46","sceneId":"s0","text":"Life who was not loth to trade her"},{"id":"s0-47","sceneId":"s0","text":"Unto death, has done"},{"id":"s0-48","sceneId":"s0","text":"Better than he planned, has made her"},{"id":"s0-49","sceneId":"s0","text":"Wise as Solomon."},{"id":"s0-50","sceneId":"s0","text":"Now she knows the Why and Wherefore,"},{"id":"s0-51","sceneId":"s0","text":"Troublous Whence and Whither,"},{"id":"s0-52","sceneId":"s0","text":"Why men strive and sweat, and care for"},{"id":"s0-53","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bays that droop and wither."},{"id":"s0-54","sceneId":"s0","text":"All the stars she knows by name,"},{"id":"s0-55","sceneId":"s0","text":"End and origin thereof,"},{"id":"s0-56","sceneId":"s0","text":"Knows if love be kin to shame,"},{"id":"s0-57","sceneId":"s0","text":"If shame be less than love."},{"id":"s0-58","sceneId":"s0","text":"What was crooked now is straight,"},{"id":"s0-59","sceneId":"s0","text":"What was rough is plain;"},{"id":"s0-60","sceneId":"s0","text":"Grief and sorrow have no weight"},{"id":"s0-61","sceneId":"s0","text":"Now to cause her pain."},{"id":"s0-62","sceneId":"s0","text":"Plain to her why fevered blisters"},{"id":"s0-63","sceneId":"s0","text":"Made her dark hands run,"},{"id":"s0-64","sceneId":"s0","text":"While her favored, fairer sisters"},{"id":"s0-65","sceneId":"s0","text":"Neither wrought nor spun;"},{"id":"s0-66","sceneId":"s0","text":"Clear to her the hidden reason"},{"id":"s0-67","sceneId":"s0","text":"Men daily fret and toil,"},{"id":"s0-68","sceneId":"s0","text":"5"},{"id":"s0-69","sceneId":"s0","text":"Staving death off for a season"},{"id":"s0-70","sceneId":"s0","text":"Till soil return to soil."},{"id":"s0-71","sceneId":"s0","text":"One to her are flame and frost;"},{"id":"s0-72","sceneId":"s0","text":"Silence is her singing lark;"},{"id":"s0-73","sceneId":"s0","text":"We alone are children, lost,"},{"id":"s0-74","sceneId":"s0","text":"Crying in the dark."},{"id":"s0-75","sceneId":"s0","text":"Varied feature now, and form,"},{"id":"s0-76","sceneId":"s0","text":"Change has bred upon her;"},{"id":"s0-77","sceneId":"s0","text":"Crush no bug nor nauseous worm"},{"id":"s0-78","sceneId":"s0","text":"Lest you tread upon her."},{"id":"s0-79","sceneId":"s0","text":"Pluck no flower lest she scream;"},{"id":"s0-80","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bruise no slender reed,"},{"id":"s0-81","sceneId":"s0","text":"Lest it prove more than it seem,"},{"id":"s0-82","sceneId":"s0","text":"Lest she groan and bleed."},{"id":"s0-83","sceneId":"s0","text":"More than ever trust your brother,"},{"id":"s0-84","sceneId":"s0","text":"Read him golden, pure;"},{"id":"s0-85","sceneId":"s0","text":"It may be she finds no other"},{"id":"s0-86","sceneId":"s0","text":"House so safe and sure."},{"id":"s0-87","sceneId":"s0","text":"Set no poet carving"},{"id":"s0-88","sceneId":"s0","text":"Rhymes to make her laugh;"},{"id":"s0-89","sceneId":"s0","text":"Only live hearts starving"},{"id":"s0-90","sceneId":"s0","text":"Need an epitaph."},{"id":"s0-91","sceneId":"s0","text":"Lay upon her no white stone"},{"id":"s0-92","sceneId":"s0","text":"From a foreign quarry;"},{"id":"s0-93","sceneId":"s0","text":"6"},{"id":"s0-94","sceneId":"s0","text":"Earth and sky be these alone"},{"id":"s0-95","sceneId":"s0","text":"Her obituary."}]}